!
! Keyword-based startup file: GLACIER test case (ICEPLUME)
! Replicates Iceplume_Test of ROMS-ICEPLUME (C. Wang):
!   50x3x30 points, dx=dy=220 m, h=200 m, f=1e-4, glacier at i<=1,
!   open boundary east, halocline at 50 m, 1 plume at the glacier face.
! Default: 1 day (NTIMES=2880, dt=30 s). For a full spin-up of the
! outflow use >= 10 days (NTIMES=28800); see README_ICEPLUME.md.
!
title:
	GLACIER: subglacial discharge plume (ICEPLUME) Example
time_stepping: NTIMES   dt[sec]  NDTFAST  NINFO
               2880      30        15      20
S-coord: THETA_S,   THETA_B,    Hc (m)
           4.0d0      0.1d0       100.d0
initial: NRREC  filename
          0
                          glacier_rst.nc
restart:          NRST, NRPFRST / filename
                  2880     -1
                          glacier_rst.nc
history: LDEFHIS, NWRT, NRPFHIS / filename
            T      120      0
                          glacier_his.nc
primary_history_fields: zeta UBAR VBAR  U  V   wrtT(1:NT)
                          T    T   T   T  T    30*T
auxiliary_history_fields:   rho Omega W  Akv  Akt  Aks Visc3d Diff3d  HBL HBBL Bostr Bustr Bvstr Wstr Ustr Vstr Shfl rsw rlw lat sen Hm HEL BIOL
                             T   F    T   T    T    F   F      F       F   F    F    F     F      20*F
gls_history_fields:   TKE  GLS  Lscale
                      T     F    F
rho0:
      1025.
bottom_drag:     RDRG(m/s),      RDRG2, Zob [m],  Cdb_min, Cdb_max
                 3.0E-04         0.     0.        0.       0.
vertical_mixing: Akv_bak, Akt_bak [m^2/sec]
                 1.e-9    1.e-10 1.e-10  1.e-10
lateral_visc:   VISC2,    VISC4    [m^2/sec for all]
                0.3       0.
tracer_diff2: TNU2(1:NT)           [m^2/sec for all]
              0.d0  0.d0  0.d0
gamma2:
                 1.
nudg_cof:    TauT_in, TauT_out, TauM_in, TauM_out  [days for all]
                 3.       360.      3.      360.
lin_EOS_cff:  R0 [kg/m3], T0 [Celsius], S0 [PSU], TCOEF [1/Celsius], SCOEF [1/PSU]
              27.         4.            35.       0.                 0.
!
! Point source at the glacier face: u-face Isrc=2 between the land
! cell i=1 (glacier) and the wet cell i=2; no conventional river
! discharge (Qbar=0). Tracers: T, S, passive (discharge tracer).
!
psource:   Nsrc  Isrc  Jsrc  Dsrc  Qbar [m3/s]    Lsrc        Tsrc
           1
                 2      2    0      0.           T T T       0. 0. 0.
!
! ICEPLUME: SG_typ SG_dep SG_len SG_bar SG_trc(1:NT) Istr Iend Jstr Jend
!   Default (as in the ROMS code Iceplume_Test/src/ana_psource.h):
!     type 4 (sheet), bottom (dep>=0), 220 m wide, 100 m3/s,
!     T=0 degC, S=0, passive tracer=1, DET_AVERAGE window i=2..8, j=1..3
!   Alternative (ROMS-ICEPLUME README / task statement):
!     type 3 (finite line), 220 m wide, 200 m3/s:
!                3    1.    220.    200.   0.  0.  1.   2  8  1  3
!
iceplume:  SG_typ SG_dep SG_len SG_bar  SG_trc(1:NT)  Irange Jrange
                4    1.    220.    100.   0.  0.  1.   2  8  1  3
